<title>PHILIPPINES: Phil Racing posts 2.673 mln peso net in Q1.</title>
<headline>Phil Racing posts 2.673 mln peso net in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Racing Club Inc posted a 2.67 million peso net income in the first three months of the year, documents submitted to the Securities and Exchange Commission on Monday showed.</p>
<p>Comparative figures were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Gross sales reached 390.93 million pesos from the 27 horse racing meets conducted throughout the period, while total expenses amounted to 35.42 million.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
